@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
allowmixing
title AFTER MVP — Proposed / conditional — Runner architecture and trust isolation
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Trusted coordination boundary" {
 database "Immutable attempt / dispatch / claim / evidence" as D
 queue "Logical admitted work lane\nno broker selected" as Q
 component "Authenticated scoped executor adapter" as A
 D --> Q
 Q --> A
}
rectangle "Required untrusted execution containment\nmechanism unselected / enabling evidence pending" as U {
 component "Attempt-scoped workspace and process tree" as W
 folder "Scoped bounded cache/output area\nonly if actual policy permits" as C
 W --> C
}
rectangle "Privileged target boundary" {
 component "Trusted deployment adapter\nexact independent target approval" as T
}
A --> W : actual eligible attributable launch
W --> D : authenticated scoped observations only
note bottom of W
 Deny host/admin/production data and credentials; isolate other jobs.
 Cache cannot leak secrets or bypass input/provenance checks.
 Container labels and local leases are not isolation or remote-stop evidence.
end note

@enduml
